tation could effectively lower the concentration of the trafficand coal combustion-related trace elements. Therefore, water spray to simulate natural types of precipitation could be
one of the abatement strategies to facilitate the reduction of
ambient PM2.5 trace elements in the urban atmosphere. Collectively, our findings in this study provide baseline levels
and sources of trace elements with high detail, which are
needed for developing effective control strategies to reduce
the high risk of acute exposure to atmospheric trace elements
in China’s megacities.

