ASSESSMENT AND HEALTH RISK STUDY OF SOME HEAVY METALS IN
INSTANT SOUP AND CHICKEN STOCK PRODUCTS FROM JORDANIAN
MARKET
Safwan MF1* and MA Amayreh2

Safwan Fraihat

*Corresponding author email: s.fraihat@ju.edu.jo
